<title>AUSTRALIA: Rugby League-ARL to name Australia team after grand final.</title>
<headline>Rugby League-ARL to name Australia team after grand final.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian team to play Papua New Guinea next month will be announced shortly after Sunday's grand final, the Australian Rugby League (ARL) said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Australia will play the ARL-aligned Papua New Guinea in Port Moresby on October 6.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
